     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am a new Shiny user and I would like &quot;the client&quot; to be able to upload a WAV file to the Shiny server</div><div>It is not possible to use the input$mydata with WAV objects (because a character vector argument is expected) </div><div>I do not think any renderX() function available is appropriate to perform this task</div><div><br></div><div>Here is my function to upload a wave file into R:</div><div><br></div><div><div>loadWav &lt;- function(file.path, plot = FALSE){</div><div>    fileName &lt;- unlist(strsplit(basename(file.path), &quot;[.]wav&quot;))</div><div>    w &lt;- seewave::inputw(tuneR::readWave(file.path))</div><div>    if(isS4(w)) pcm &lt;- slot(w,&quot;pcm&quot;) else pcm &lt;- TRUE</div><div>    w &lt;- tuneR::Wave(left = w$w, samp.rate = w$f, bit = w$bit, pcm = TRUE)</div><div>    if(plot){</div><div>      oldAsk &lt;- unlist(options(&quot;device.ask.default&quot;))</div><div>      options(device.ask.default = TRUE)</div><div>      on.exit(options(device.ask.default = oldAsk))</div><div>      plot(w) ## tuneR::plot,Wave,missing-method</div><div>    }</div><div>    return(w)</div><div>  }</div></div><div><br></div><div>I would like to merge that with the Shiny import function:</div><div><div style=\"line-height:14.5199995040894px;margin-top:13px;margin-bottom:13px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.1999998092651px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:0px!important;float:none!important;min-height:auto!important;outline:0px!important;overflow:visible!important;padding-right:1em!important;padding-left:1em!important;width:auto!important;box-sizing:content-box!important;direction:ltr!important;white-space:pre!important;background-image:none!important;background-size:initial!important;background-origin:initial!important;background-clip:initial!important;background-position:initial!important;background-repeat:initial!important\"><code style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:1em!important;line-height:1.1em!important;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace!important;display:inline!important;overflow:visible!important;border-radius:0px!important;float:none!important;min-height:auto!important;outline:0px!important;width:auto!important;box-sizing:content-box!important;direction:ltr!important;color:rgb(0,130,0)!important;background:none!important\"># server.R</code></div><div style=\"line-height:14.5199995040894px;margin-top:13px;margin-bottom:13px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.1999998092651px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:0px!important;float:none!important;min-height:auto!important;outline:0px!important;overflow:visible!important;padding-right:1em!important;padding-left:1em!important;width:auto!important;box-sizing:content-box!important;direction:ltr!important;white-space:pre!important;background-image:none!important;background-size:initial!important;background-origin:initial!important;background-clip:initial!important;background-position:initial!important;background-repeat:initial!important\"><code style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:1em!important;line-height:1.1em!important;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace!important;display:inline!important;overflow:visible!important;border-radius:0px!important;float:none!important;min-height:auto!important;outline:0px!important;width:auto!important;box-sizing:content-box!important;direction:ltr!important;color:rgb(255,20,147)!important;background:none!important\">shinyServer</code><code style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:1em!important;line-height:1.1em!important;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace!important;display:inline!important;overflow:visible!important;border-radius:0px!important;float:none!import